msgid ""
"This method should not be used from within a dependency provider, as it can "
"result in deadlocks: When solved dynamically, a dependency can request "
"itself, creating a cycle, which can only be checked exhaustively if all "
"dependencies are declared upfront. A best-effort check is performed to "
"prevent calling this method from within a dependency, but it should not be "
"relied on."
